From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: smit1237 <smit1237@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 22:47:49 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 11/30] wifi: AIC8800 STA/AP support for the W variant

Build the out-of-tree AIC8800 fullmac driver from osdrv (Bluetooth disabled,
Cvitek cross-build, other wireless vendors gated off in the M= pass) and
enable the wifi userspace. S35wifi brings up STA/AP/concurrent modes per
/etc/rnsbox/wifi.conf including TX-power control and HT40 inheritance, and is
a clean no-op on the radio-less board. The board defconfig also disables the
MIPI panel and camera sensors.
---
